===Noun===
{{ar-noun|شَحْم|m|pl=شُحُوم}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|شَحَمَ|form=I}}
# [[grease]], [[fat]], [[lard]], [[suet]], [[schmaltz]]; also [[greasy]] [[pulp]] like of the [[colocynth]] or [[pomegranate]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|شَحْم|pl=شُحُوم}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|شَحْمَة|t=piece of fat}}
* {{l|ar|شَحْمِيّ|t=[[lipic]], [[stearic]]}}
* {{l|ar|بِشَحْمِهِ وَلَحْمِهِ|t=living and breathing|lit=by his fat and his flesh|tr=bi-šaḥmi-hī wa-laḥmi-hī}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|mt|xaħam}}
* {{desc|pt|acém|bor=1}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.vn:شَحَم.ap:++,+++}}

# to be [[desirous]] of (eating) [[fat]] {{q|of a person}}
# to become [[plump]] and [[full]] {{q|of fruit}}

