{{ar-conj|I/a~a.vn:شَحْم}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|II}}

# to [[grease]], to smear with [[fat]], to [[oil]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|II}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|mt|xaħħam}}

===Adjective===
{{ar-adj|شَحِم}}

# [[desirous]] of [[fat]]
# [[pappy]], [[mushy]], of a [[texture]] resembling [[fat]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-adj|شَحِم}}

